# =============================================================================
# HOW TO READ THESE LOGS:
#
# SRC=      → Source IP (attacker)
# DST=      → Destination IP (your server)
# PROTO=    → Protocol (TCP, UDP, ICMP)
# SPT=      → Source port (attacker's port)
# DPT=      → Destination port (what they're hitting on your server)
# SYN       → SYN flag set (new connection attempt)
# URG PSH FIN → XMAS scan flags
# (no flags) → NULL scan
# IPT-*:    → Which rule caught this packet
